<title>USA: United Natural Foods Q1 shr net profit.</title>
<headline>United Natural Foods Q1 shr net profit.</headline>
<dateline>DAYVILLE, Conn. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr  profit     $0.14	   loss   $0.06</p>
<p> Net  profit     1,387	   loss   631</p>
<p> Sales	     99,501		   94,822</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  10,130		   10,135</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is United Natural Foods Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: Period ended October 31.</p>
<p>The first quarter 1997 included a $400,000 or $0.04 per share charge to replenish the allowance for doubtful accounts. Fiscal 1996 Q1 included a $1.6 million nonrecurring charge of $0.16 for write-off of intangible assets. The company completed its IPO on November 1.</p>
